<import src="../../components/states.wxml"/><view class="page"><template is="feedback" data="{{loading,error}}"/><block wx:if="{{!loading && !error}}"><view class="eyebrow">KEEP THIS LITTLE MOMENT</view><view class="heading">今天的坚持，值得被记住。</view><view wx:if="{{!signedIn}}" class="card section"><button class="btn" data-url="/pages/account/index" bindtap="go"><image class="feature-entry-icon" src="/images/ui/edit.svg" mode="aspectFit"/><text>登录后生成我的海报</text></button></view><block wx:else><view class="card section"><picker mode="date" value="{{date}}" start="2000-01-01" end="{{today}}" bindchange="date"><view class="picker">海报日期 {{date}} ⌄</view></picker><view class="switch-row"><view class="grow"><text class="title">在海报中展示体重</text><text class="caption">默认隐藏，只在主动开启且当天有记录时绘制。</text></view><switch color="#1d6651" checked="{{showWeight}}" bindchange="weight"/></view><button class="btn mt" bindtap="generate" disabled="{{busy}}">生成我的海报</button><canvas canvas-id="sharePoster" class="poster-canvas" style="width:300px;height:400px"/><image wx:if="{{poster}}" class="poster-image" src="{{poster}}" mode="widthFix"/><view wx:if="{{poster}}" class="footer-buttons mt"><button class="btn soft" bindtap="preview">预览</button><button class="btn" bindtap="share">分享</button></view></view><view class="notice section">点击分享后，在微信图片菜单中选择发送给好友、群聊或朋友圈；可用选项以当前微信版本为准。</view></block></block><view class="footnote">轻动 · 让健康成为一种日常</view></view>
